# 2026-09-19. Both boards on one Mac, two serial ports read at once. XIAO = firmware/17_stream,
# BOX-3 = firmware/19_box3_link (serial-only receiver). ESP-NOW broadcast, channel 1.
# BOX3 lines are what arrived by radio; XIAO lines are what it printed on USB at the same moment.
# First the BOX-3 just listens; then the host types 'z' into the BOX-3's serial port, the BOX-3
# broadcasts it, and the XIAO obeys it.

